@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 8

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    BorderColor #1A1A1A
    BorderThickness 1.5
    FontSize 12
    FontStyle bold
    FontColor #1A1A1A
}

skinparam usecase {
    BackgroundColor #111827
    BorderColor #111827
    BorderThickness 2
    FontSize 14
    FontStyle bold
    FontColor #FFFFFF
}

skinparam arrow {
    Color #374151
    FontColor #1F2937
    FontSize 10
    Thickness 1.2
}

top to bottom direction

rectangle "**Chapter Officer**\n[External Entity]" as Officer
rectangle "**DeMolay Member**\n[External Entity]" as Member
rectangle "**System Administrator**\n[External Entity]" as Admin
rectangle "**Email / SMTP Service**\n[External Entity]" as SmtpService

usecase "**0**\n\n**BloodMatch System**\n\n(Peer-to-Peer Blood Donor Matching\nand Coordination Platform)" as System

Officer -down-> System : 1. Login Credentials\n2. Verification Decisions & Provenance Upgrades\n3. Donation Confirmations / Rejections\n4. Manual Match Regeneration Commands\n5. Chapter-Scoped Queries & Filters
System -up-> Officer : 1. Authentication Result & Scoped Permissions\n2. Pending Verifications & Submitted Documents\n3. Pending Donation Reports\n4. Chapter Requests & Donor Pool Readiness\n5. Chapter Demand Aggregations & Analytics\n6. Chapter-Scoped Audit Logs & Alerts

Member -right-> System : 1. Registration & Profile Details\n2. Login Credentials & Password Resets\n3. Verification Documents (ID / Donor Card / Consent)\n4. Donor Enrollment & Availability Updates\n5. Blood Request Submissions\n6. Request Edits & Cancellation\n7. Match Response (Willingness to Donate)\n8. Completed Donation Reports\n9. Notification Read Status & Preferences
System -left-> Member : 1. Authentication Status & Permissions\n2. Profile, Verification & Donor Status\n3. Standby (42h) / Cooldown (90d) Status\n4. Blood Request Details & Status Updates\n5. Potentially Compatible Matches (Anonymized)\n6. In-App Notifications & Alerts

Admin -left-> System : 1. Login Credentials\n2. User Role & Chapter Assignments\n3. Account Deactivation / Reactivation\n4. Administrative Overrides & Decisions\n5. System-Wide Audit & Analytics Queries
System -right-> Admin : 1. Authentication Status & Admin Permissions\n2. System-Wide User Directory & States\n3. Platform Analytics & Resolution Rates\n4. Regional Demand & 3-Chapter Matrix\n5. Complete, Immutable System Audit Trail\n6. Admin Dashboard Metrics & Platform Health

System -down-> SmtpService : Email Notification Content\n(Recipient Address, Subject, HTML Body)
SmtpService -up-> System : Delivery Status & Send Response

@enduml